    <!-- Company History Section -->
    <section style="padding: 80px 0;">
        <div class="container">
            <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
                <h2 style="font-size: 40px; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 2rem; text-align: center;">Our Story</h2>
                <div style="background: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #4099FF; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
                    <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        In 2003, Ali Saberi established Atrinova as an enterprise SAP consulting firm, serving businesses with world-class technology solutions. Over the years, the company evolved beyond consulting, expanding into communications and payment processing to address the growing needs of enterprise clients.
                    </p>
                    <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #4b5563; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        In 2020, the company rebranded as Tilli Software, marking a new chapter focused entirely on digital transformation for billing and customer communications. Today, Tilli employs 200+ professionals with a global presence, serving enterprise clients across utilities, government, healthcare, and financial services.
                    </p>
                    <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #4b5563;">
                        Our platform combines tilliX (digital engagement portal), Nudge (communications platform), and tilliPay (payment orchestration) to help businesses go 100% digital, reduce costs by 40%, and get paid 3X faster.
                    </p>
                </div>
